<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rumors were true...</font>

28
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:12,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That the survivor of the Village's
honorable Uchiha Clan</font>

29
