<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was the most good-for-nothing kid...</font>

30
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun you must be hungry.
Is there something you want to eat?</font>

31
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go buy something for you.</font>

32
