<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I Want to Fight You!</font>

33
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:42,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Finally
They Clash,</font>

34
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:42,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sasuke vs Naruto</font>

35
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be honest
I really don't understand.</font>

36
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:49,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems there were opinions that</font>

37
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the final exam being suspended</font>

38
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no one should pass
this time around.</font>

39
00:02:56,360 --> 00:03:01,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I hear the late Third Hokage
highly praised your match.</font>

40
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he intended to recommend you
for Chunin.</font>

41
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lords of other lands
who observed the fight</font>

42
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the proctors were of
the same opinion as well...</font>

43
00:03:12,130 --> 00:03:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case it's not in my place
to say this or that about it.</font>

44
00:03:16,130 --> 00:03:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on</font>

45
00:03:17,130 --> 00:03:20,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">strive to perform in a manner
that is worthy of that headband...</font>

46
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations!
As of today you're a Chunin!</font>

47
00:03:27,010 --> 00:03:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wow...
— Wow!</font>

48
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even you who's never motivated
looks respectable.</font>

49
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't suit you.</font>

50
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh I say...</font>

51
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being</font>

52
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">let's have a toast to celebrate
Shikamaru's promotion to Chunin!</font>

53
00:03:44,370 --> 00:03:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat!</font>

54
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:48,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Choji!</font>

55
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't eat the meat before the toast!</font>

56
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it'd be a waste if it got burned so...</font>

57
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:56,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a lot of meat. Eat up!</font>

58
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

59
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now
I have no interest in you...</font>

60
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your target is Naruto after all.</font>

61
00:05:07,030 --> 00:05:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll end up in the hospital again, Choji.</font>

62
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you know how to savor the taste?</font>

63
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never mind!</font>

64
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I eat a lot
I know how to savor properly.</font>

65
00:05:22,710 --> 00:05:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Choji, that's the last piece of meat
that I've been grilling!</font>

66
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The last bite!</font>

67
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the conclusion and</font>

68
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will become the meat with
the greatest value that should be savored!</font>

69
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't hand over
this last bite to anyone!</font>

70
00:05:39,650 --> 00:05:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you acting cool for
you idiot?!</font>

71
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:46,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone makes fun of you
because you're like this!</font>

72
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You're just a fa...
— Ino!</font>

73
00:05:49,030 --> 00:05:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a taboo word!</font>

74
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But really, Choji...</font>

75
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:54,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A meal isn't a battle.</font>

76
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:57,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Relax at a time like this at least.
What a pain.</font>

77
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vulgar... Dirty-mouthed...
Too lazy...</font>

78
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if these guys
will be okay from here.</font>

79
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In particular...</font>

80
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji. With you it's nothing but food.</font>

81
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:17,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do a little training sometime!</font>

82
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...</font>

83
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're lucky that your mind
doesn't restrict what you eat...</font>

84
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:43,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got it rough with a diet.</font>

85
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you have to diet, Ino?</font>

86
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:52,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Girls want to be seen as cute as possible
by the one they like!</font>

87
00:06:54,890 --> 00:06:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that person might not always
like a thin person.</font>

88
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place
most boys don't like fa...</font>

89
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:04,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not that... They like thin girls.</font>

90
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And vice-versa.</font>

91
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should be a little more conscious
of your body, Choji.</font>

92
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be popular.</font>

93
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... She doesn't get it.</font>

94
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Men don't like thin women
as much as women think.</font>

95
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More likely men who like chubby women
are the most common.</font>

96
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:37,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And vice-versa... I'd say.</font>

97
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet she'd be twice as popular</font>

98
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:44,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if she were to gain a little more weight
instead of dieting.</font>

99
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:51,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure are a funny guy, Shikamaru.</font>

100
00:07:51,450 --> 00:07:53,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you're smart too.</font>

101
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

102
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know it in my heart...</font>

103
00:07:56,200 --> 00:08:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're much more awesome
than the likes of Sasuke or Neji.</font>

104
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:09,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well I've never even thought about that.
I'm me so...</font>

105
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you're the only one
who became a Chunin</font>

106
00:08:12,470 --> 00:08:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the Chunin Exam this time...</font>

107
00:08:15,470 --> 00:08:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you might be better
at fighting, right?</font>

108
00:08:20,180 --> 00:08:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might've given up if
I'd gotten into one with you.</font>

109
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But earlier
Sensei told me that all I do is eat</font>

110
00:08:27,110 --> 00:08:28,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and that I'm not progressing...</font>

111
00:08:28,650 --> 00:08:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm me, I tell you. And you're you.</font>

112
00:08:33,110 --> 00:08:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's stupid talking about how which is.</font>

113
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, don't worry too much
about what Asuma says...</font>

114
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should live naturally
and take things easy.</font>

115
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later! I'm going home.</font>

116
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dad's starting to say
some troublesome thing</font>

117
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like he's going to teach me
a new Jutsu or something.</font>

118
00:08:55,970 --> 00:08:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru.</font>

119
00:08:57,930 --> 00:08:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

120
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

121
00:09:04,890 --> 00:09:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good luck with your training.</font>

122
00:09:10,730 --> 00:09:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

123
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a good guy... Choji.</font>

124
00:09:34,260 --> 00:09:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura-chan!</font>

125
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:40,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

126
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time is right...</font>

127
00:09:50,310 --> 00:09:52,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Head for the Leaf Village now!</font>

128
00:09:57,450 --> 00:10:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... You've made up your mind, huh?</font>

129
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

130
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm carrying out fitness training
to get ready for the surgery.</font>

131
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to return as soon as
I can after the surgery so...</font>

132
00:10:10,210 --> 00:10:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow!</font>

133
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow, ow...</font>

134
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

135
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes?! What is it?</font>

136
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't die
if you give up being a Shinobi.</font>

137
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you so fixated
on being a Shinobi?</font>

138
00:10:38,450 --> 00:10:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My everything is proving that
even I can become a fine Ninja...</font>

139
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might die. Even if you succeed...</font>

140
00:10:52,130 --> 00:10:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so...</font>

141
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise you!</font>

142
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my dream so...</font>

143
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... do you snap this much
at the mention of Hokage's name?</font>

144
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:09,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike you...</font>

145
00:11:09,140 --> 00:11:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will be the heir to the name
of Hokage no matter what!</font>

146
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because Hokage is my dream!</font>

147
00:11:18,650 --> 00:11:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this village promising children
are being brought up.</font>

148
00:11:25,530 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi-sensei... Sure enough
you were a wonderful Hokage.</font>

149
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The surgery is in the afternoon.
Get ready!</font>

150
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:38,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Lee! Are you prepared?!</font>

151
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

152
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got some apples...
You like them right?</font>

153
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here doesn't it look good?</font>

154
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? I wonder where I put the knife...</font>

155
00:11:58,650 --> 00:12:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's right in front of you.</font>

156
00:12:00,990 --> 00:12:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's so lame you getting all scatterbrained
just because you're in front of Sasuke.</font>

157
00:12:05,490 --> 00:12:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd rather hear lame
from anyone but you...</font>

158
00:12:06,830 --> 00:12:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

159
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U! Zu! Ma! Ki!</font>

160
00:12:10,830 --> 00:12:13,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto 2K Barrage!</font>

161
00:12:17,590 --> 00:12:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off already!</font>

162
00:12:20,010 --> 00:12:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

163
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will... protect Sakura-chan!</font>

164
00:12:27,510 --> 00:12:29,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I give up...</font>

165
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Thank you.</font>

166
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You rescued me from
the Sand Ninja right?</font>

167
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

168
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who rescued you...
was Naruto.</font>

169
00:13:00,710 --> 00:13:02,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are weak.</font>

170
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:09,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you weak...?</font>

171
00:13:09,310 --> 00:13:11,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you don't have enough...</font>

172
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...hate.</font>

173
00:13:15,690 --> 00:13:17,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good. I peeled it nicely.</font>

174
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll cut it to make it easy to eat and...</font>

175
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here Sasuke-kun.</font>

176
00:13:26,070 --> 00:13:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow! What happened?</font>

177
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke-kun?</font>

178
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's going on?</font>

179
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What?</font>

180
00:13:39,420 --> 00:13:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You don't have to glare
at me like that.</font>

181
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto...</font>

182
00:13:48,090 --> 00:13:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What is it?</font>

183
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight me... Right now!</font>

184
00:13:53,470 --> 00:13:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Here you are
just treated by Granny Tsunade.</font>

185
00:13:57,810 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?</font>

186
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just fight!</font>

187
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:05,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

188
00:14:05,490 --> 00:14:07,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think you saved me?</font>

189
00:14:07,990 --> 00:14:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care if she's the Fifth Hokage
or whatever but...</font>

190
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she should've just minded
her own business!</font>

191
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

192
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said you wanted to fight me, right?</font>

193
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying let's do it now!</font>

194
00:14:21,670 --> 00:14:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or have you chickened out?</font>

195
00:14:25,590 --> 00:14:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke-kun. Hey...
What's going on?!</font>

196
00:14:29,430 --> 00:14:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you say something too!</font>

197
00:14:31,970 --> 00:14:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this all of a sudden?</font>

198
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is perfect!</font>

199
00:14:38,190 --> 00:14:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just thinking
I wanted to fight you!</font>

200
00:14:41,270 --> 00:14:44,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop it the both of you... Okay?</font>

201
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with me!</font>

202
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:42,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's... this feeling?
My lower belly feels tight...</font>

203
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to fight you too.</font>

204
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:49,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... I feel a thrill.</font>

205
00:15:54,930 --> 00:15:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so funny?</font>

206
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:59,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing's funny!
I'm happy!</font>

207
00:16:00,390 --> 00:16:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I think
I can finally beat you here!</font>

208
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Abducting Naruto-kun is the No.1 priority
of our organization, Akatsuki.</font>

209
00:16:14,990 --> 00:16:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?
Don't talk foolish, you failure!</font>

210
00:16:18,490 --> 00:16:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to be
a failure forever!</font>

211
00:16:25,130 --> 00:16:28,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now
I have no interest in you...</font>

212
00:16:32,630 --> 00:16:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... A loser like you better
not act all high and mighty!</font>

213
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! It's unlike you to lose
your cool and raise a fuss.</font>

214
00:16:40,890 --> 00:16:42,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So uncharacteristic.</font>

215
00:16:42,730 --> 00:16:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be that you picked a fight
and then got scared could it Sasuke?</font>

216
00:16:47,650 --> 00:16:48,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just bring it, now!</font>

217
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Put on your headband before that!
I'll wait.</font>

218
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need such a thing...</font>

219
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:56,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just do it!</font>

220
00:16:58,450 --> 00:17:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wouldn't even be able...
to put one scratch on my forehead!</font>

221
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong!</font>

222
00:17:05,580 --> 00:17:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying this is a testament to fighting
on equal terms as a Leaf Shinobi!</font>

223
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'm saying stuff like that
is acting high and mighty!</font>

224
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think that we're equal?!</font>

225
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I do! I've never once
thought that I'm inferior to you!</font>

226
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:24,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an eyesore!</font>

227
00:17:25,190 --> 00:17:29,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because you remain weak!
Sasuke-chan!</font>

228
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

229
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

230
00:18:20,990 --> 00:18:22,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be getting carried away!</font>

231
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

232
00:18:44,470 --> 00:18:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough already!</font>

233
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

234
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U! Zu! Ma! Ki!</font>

235
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barrage!</font>

236
00:20:01,590 --> 00:20:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Tiger Seal!</font>

237
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:06,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style! Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

238
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto!</font>

239
00:20:29,950 --> 00:20:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What is that Jutsu?!</font>

240
00:20:37,630 --> 00:20:38,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

241
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chidori: One Thousand Birds!</font>

242
00:20:45,050 --> 00:20:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop...</font>

243
00:20:46,850 --> 00:20:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll win no matter what!</font>

244
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't flatter yourself!</font>

245
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it both of you...</font>

246
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:58,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

